    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Optional signed unsubscribe webhook\n\n**POST** body: `{ \"invoiceId\": \"INV-1001\" }`\n\n**Auth:** header `X-Chase-Secret` must equal n8n env `CHASE_UNSUBSCRIBE_SECRET` (placeholder `REPLACE_WITH_CHASE_UNSUBSCRIBE_SECRET` in Code node fallback). **Reject** missing/wrong secret (401).\n\nOn success: set Sheet **Status = Paused** (+ Notes timestamp). Main chase skips Paused \u2192 no further stages.\n\nDocument the secret in README / your private ops notes \u2014 **never commit a real secret** in this JSON.\n\nReplace `REPLACE_WITH_SPREADSHEET_ID`; attach **Google Sheets account** credential by name only.",
        "height": 400,
